  <name>Steuererklärung</name>
  <summary>Tax return and bookkeeping for small businesses</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Receipts, transactions and invoices in one place. From them the app computes the income-surplus statement (EÜR), the VAT returns, trade tax and the separate assessment for partnerships, and files them through ELSTER.</p>
    <p>It runs on your machine: your bank data and documents stay in a local store. Every figure can be traced back to the transaction it came from.</p>
    <p>It works fully without AI: you write your own classification rules instead of letting a model guess. An assistant is optional and off by default.</p>
    <p>The tax logic follows German law, so the interface keeps the official German terms. The app is a preparation aid, not tax advice.</p>
  </description>
